## 8. browser QA results — TZ-170.B (2026-07-25 follow-up session)

**Approach:** This section records the browser QA attempt performed as successor-TZ "TZ-170.B". Results are split into two categories: (a) WHAT was actually verifiable under the constraints of this session, and (b) WHAT was deferred because of tooling limitations.

### 8.1 Infrastructure verified BEFORE browser session

| Check | Result | Evidence |
|-------|--------|----------|
| Docker daemon | ✓ running | `docker --version` 29.6.1; `kppdf-mongo` container healthy on :27017 |
| Node + pnpm | ✓ available | `node v24.18.0`, `pnpm 11.13.1` |
| Build artifacts | ✓ present | `backend/dist/`, `frontend/dist/` both pre-built, `node_modules` populated |
| `node start.mjs --check` | ✓ PASS | preflight completed; freed occupied :4200 (killed PID 14236) |
| Backend `/api/health` | ✓ 200 OK | `{"status":"ok","info":{"mongo":{"status":"up"},"memory":{"status":"up"},"disk":{"status":"up"}}}` |
| Frontend `/` | ✓ 200 OK | Angular SPA served on :4200 |
| Backend logs | mostly healthy | TUI logged Mongo connect + NestFactory.create + http server listening on :3000 |

### 8.2 Manual API smoke (functional, not visual)

| Endpoint | Method | Result | Notes |
|----------|--------|--------|-------|
| `/api/auth/login` | POST | ✓ 200 OK with JWT | Required field is `username` (not `login`); responds with `accessToken` (~250 char JWT) |
| `/api/document-templates` | GET | ✓ 200 (auth-protected) | Returns list of templates (TZ-86 default seed) |
| `/api/text-blocks?isActive=true` | GET | ✓ 200 | Returns active text blocks for inline toolbar dropdown |
| `/api/table-templates?isActive=true` | GET | ✓ 200 | Returns active table templates |

### 8.3 Static code-level proof of TZ-170 features (NEW or UPDATED)

The 22 acceptance items from TZ-170 §3.1-§3.4 were not individually QA'd in a browser session. Instead, the following static-verification evidence was gathered:

| Acceptance item | Static evidence | Verdict |
|-----------------|-----------------|---------|
| §3.1.1 Click empty canvas → template properties panel | `builder-canvas.component.ts:onCanvasClick()` checks `target.closest('.block-renderer')` → emits `canvasClick` → `builder.page.ts:onCanvasClick()` sets `templateSelected.set(true)` → `builder-inspector.component.ts` template branch renders | ✓ Static ✅ Cross-references builder-inspector template branch visible in source |
| §3.1.2 Orientation Книжная↔Альбомная buttons | `builder-inspector.component.ts` has 2 .orientation-btn icons (BookOpen, Columns) + emits `templateUpdate({orientation})` | ✓ Static ✅ |
| §3.1.3 Page size A3/A4/A5 buttons | 3 `.orientation-btn--sm` buttons labeled A3/A4/A5 in `builder-inspector.component.ts`; `pi-canvas-page.component.ts` has `--a3` and `--a5` CSS variants | ✓ Static ✅ |
| §3.1.4 Opacity slider 0-100% | `render`<input type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.05">` + `opacityPercent()` computed | ✓ Static ✅ |
| §3.1.5 Загрузка фона | `render` upload button; `builder.page.ts:onBackgroundUpload` validates PNG/JPEG/WebP + 5MB; calls `templatesSvc.uploadBackground` | ✓ Static ✅ (file upload via input type=file in HTML — standard multipart form) |
| §3.1.6-1.7 Header/footer inputs | `render` `<input class="field__input">` for `headerText` + `footerText`; emit `templateUpdate` with text | ✓ Static ✅ |
| §3.1.8 Page numbering toggle | `app-pi-switch [checked]="t.pageNumbering" (checkedChange)="..."` + canvas indicator `canvas-page-number` rendered when `pageNumbering()` true | ✓ Static ✅ |
| §3.2.1 Dropdown «Тексты» | `httpResource<...>` for `/api/text-blocks?isActive=true`; click item triggers `onAddTextBlock` (verified in source) | ✓ Static ✅ (API endpoint confirmed in 8.2) |
| §3.2.2 Dropdown «Таблицы» | Same pattern as texts | ✓ Static ✅ |
| §3.2.3 Кнопка «— Отступ» | button `onAddSpacer()` → calls `onAddBlock({source:'block-type',type:'spacer'})` | ✓ Static ✅ |
| §3.2.4 Фоновые изображения | bg-preview-list, ★/☆ toggle, upload/remove via builder-inspector | ✓ Static ✅ |
| §3.2.5 Оглавление toggle | tableOfContents switch in inspector | ✓ Static ✅ |
| §3.2.6 Auto-save 1500ms | builder.page.ts `save$.pipe(tap, groupBy, debounceTime(1500), switchMap)` + `savedTick` race-condition guard | ✓ Static ✅ |
| §3.2.7 Drag-and-drop | builder-canvas.component.ts uses `<div cdkDropList>` + `(cdkDropListDropped)="onDrop($event)"` implementing CDK drag-drop | ✓ Static ✅ |
| §3.3.X Design visual | paper-ink OKLCH variables throughout; 320px inspector; 2px ink border in pi-canvas-page | ⚠ Static-only (visual diff via browser screenshot would be needed) |
| §3.4 EDGE CASES | Code paths exercised → render correctly when inputs valid | ⚠ Static-only |
| §4.1 Dropdown click-outside | ✅ **2026-07-25 fix applied this session**: `builder.page.ts` — added `host: {'(document:click)': 'onDocumentClick($event)'}` + handler that closes dropdown if `!target.closest('.builder-dropdown')`; verified via `pnpm exec tsc --noEmit` (exit 0) | ✓ Static ✅ + fix applied |

