- §3.2.7 actual mouse drag-drop reorder
- §3.3 visual 2px border inspection via screenshot diff
- §3.4 A3 landscape 1100px width visual render

**These 22 items remain TO BE DONE in a successor session with a working Chrome DevTools MCP** (rather than failure-tolerant fallbacks).

